  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anticipatory action to reduce the impact of floods on vulnerable women and girls through provision of essential SRH and GBV services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this anticipatory action project is to provide sexual/reproductive health services and protection against gender-based violence on the basis of early flood warnings for people in the east of Nepal. This UNFPA project distributes sexual and reproductive health kits and dignity kits, provides cash support for women and girls, and mobilizes psychosocial counsellors, among other activities. The project provides life-saving assistance to 19,133 women and girls in the Protection-GBV sector and to 2,865 women and girls in the Health sector.</narrative>
  </description>
